## 🚀 核心铁律：定时强制Git同步

### ⚡ **触发条件 (MANDATORY TRIGGERS)**

#### 🕐 时间触发器 (Time-based Triggers)
```javascript
// 30分钟强制同步机制
const GIT_SYNC_INTERVAL = 30 * 60 * 1000; // 30分钟 = 1800秒
let lastSyncTime = Date.now();

function shouldTriggerTimedSync() {
  const currentTime = Date.now();
  const timeSinceLastSync = currentTime - lastSyncTime;
  
  if (timeSinceLastSync >= GIT_SYNC_INTERVAL) {
    console.log(`🔥 第十一重爆雷触发：距离上次同步已过 ${Math.floor(timeSinceLastSync / 60000)} 分钟`);
    return true;
  }
  
  return false;
}
```

